# Cursor-only rules for mobile work (example)
#
# This file is a REAL file, not a symlink to CLAUDE.md, because it carries
# something the other agents do not need. Where a domain's .cursorrules would be
# a byte-for-byte duplicate, make it a symlink instead — `just eval` scores a
# duplicate down on conciseness and consistency.

- Prefer inline edits over rewriting a whole file; this project's reviewers read
  diffs, not files.
- Do not auto-run the build after each edit. It is slow enough that it breaks
  flow, and CI catches what matters.
